                                "sense_id": "d4d13e9b-19ae-30f2-a397-9865f6a35d4a",
                                "text": "A decade after introducing the idea that unscripted shows could transform prime time, “Who Wants to Be a Millionaire” returns to ABC Sunday."
                            },
